			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span><br>🚩 Black-box spam detectors that prevent users from posting a link, instead of adding a warning or whatever, but do nothing about on-site spam &amp; misinfo.<br>🚩 Special for Facebook in Canada: Blocking any links to websites deemed news content (which yes, was a response to poorly-thought-out government regulations with dubious copyright basis, but still).</p><p>On the other side, although it's much rarer in the big networks now:<br>🚩 not being able to reliably link *to* content on the site.</p>",
